{
  "plan_version": 1,
  "run_duration_s": 1800,
  "requested": { "width": 1280, "height": 720, "frame_rate": 30 },
  "operator_instructions": [
    "Fill in product_name and version for every application before a live run; run_matrix.py refuses to start without them, because the exact product build is gate evidence and cannot be recovered afterwards.",
    "Fill in harness_args for the window-capture applications, at minimum --window-title <window title> and --exe <path to the application executable> so its file version is recorded.",
    "Placeholders in angle brackets are deliberate: a live run that still contains them fails loudly instead of recording a cell against the wrong product.",
    "Bitness values are fixed by the plan and are re-checked against what the harness observed; a 32-bit consumer that cannot see the camera fails the matrix."
  ],
